OL,3,AAI to help planes avoid climate-warming
OL,4,A'sky graffiti'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe've all looked up and seen the white
OL,7,Flines trailing behind aircraft in the
OL,8,Fsky.
OL,10,FKnown as contrails, these icy clouds
OL,11,Fcontribute to climate change, and
OL,12,Fscientists have been trying to work out
OL,13,Fhow to stop them.
OL,15,FNow, a #5m UK trial will test whether
OL,16,FAI can help, by predicting where
OL,17,Fwarming contrails are likely to form
OL,18,Fand getting planes to avoid those
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,117,105,200,160,0,100
