OL,3,AAI to help planes avoid climate-warming
OL,4,A'sky graffiti'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will focus on the Shanwick Oceanic
OL,7,Fairspace in the eastern half of the
OL,8,FNorth Atlantic corridor which accounts
OL,9,Ffor approximately 5% of global contrail
OL,10,Fwarming.
